0..79 Comment "//! The buffer a read fills is moved into its submission, not borrowed, because"
80..132 Comment "//! the kernel owns it until the operation completes"
133..211 Comment "//! [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring], and it is handed back with the completion."
212..291 Comment "//! The buffer is a linear resident, here the end of a forked owner, and moving"
292..330 Comment "//! it into a submission is delegation"
331..426 Comment "//! [Honda-1998-language_primitives_type_discipline_structured_communicationbased_programming]."
